WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.358
Today we will recognise pulse and respectful listening. Our work connects with other

00:00:05.358 --> 00:00:06.152
Ghanaian communities.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:10.233
Listen to a short local rhythm and count its pulses.

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:13.764
Echo the pulse by tapping softly four times.

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:19.602
Perform the pulse with a partner, starting and stopping together. Compare your result

00:00:19.602 --> 00:00:21.711
with a second example from Ghana.
